    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOOMBOX</strong> is a bullet-heaven roguelike RPG with twin-stick action, dynamic skill synergy and elemental interactions, all wrapped up in a beautifully animated 2.5D Pixel art world.\u00a0<br><br>Play as <i>Kreek Swamptoes</i>, and defend your swamp from the legions of bug mutants that want your sludge. That's your sludge, not theirs.<br><br> Stand up for yourself and kill a LOT of lil creatures that may or may not be cuter than you, but they sure do bleed more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanying you are is the mysterious ADAM and his <strong>DOOMBOX</strong>, the source of your power. Why does he help you? Surely there is a narrative explanation?! Perhaps there will be but for now HE JUST DOES.<br><br>Grind to craft a fun array of peculiar armaments and hunt down all the hats.<br><br>What the heck is a <strong>DOOMBOX</strong> anyway?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOOMBOX</strong> is a bullet-heaven roguelike RPG with twin-stick action, dynamic skill synergy and elemental interactions, all wrapped up in a beautifully animated 2.5D Pixel art world.\u00a0<br><br>Play as <i>Kreek Swamptoes</i>, and defend your swamp from the legions of bug mutants that want your sludge. That's your sludge, not theirs.<br><br> Stand up for yourself and kill a LOT of lil creatures that may or may not be cuter than you, but they sure do bleed more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanying you are is the mysterious ADAM and his <strong>DOOMBOX</strong>, the source of your power. Why does he help you? Surely there is a narrative explanation?! Perhaps there will be but for now HE JUST DOES.<br><br>Grind to craft a fun array of peculiar armaments and hunt down all the hats.<br><br>What the heck is a <strong>DOOMBOX</strong> anyway?</p>",
    "short_description": "DOOMBOX is a survival bullet-heaven roguelike where a bazillion creatures emerge from somewhere. Craft a bunch of nifty guns, wear silly hats, and kill the crap out those creatures with over-the-top builds all fueled by the power of your DOOMBOX",
